A '''statue''' can be found inside the [[Tombs of Amascut]], inside the [[Tombs of Amascut/Strategies|Path of Het]] challenge room. It can be used to store the player's pickaxe during and after the raid. If the pickaxe is left there after completing the room or failing the raid, the player can reclaim it by starting a new raid and going to the room.

If no pickaxe is stored, the statue at the entrance to the room will be holding a free [[bronze pickaxe]].

Both charged and uncharged versions of the [[infernal pickaxe]] and its [[Infernal pickaxe (or)|trailblazer ornamental]] version can be put on the statue.

A [[cavity]] in the raid lobby can be used to deposit or retrieve pickaxes without needing to enter the raid itself.

